---
const steps = [
  {number:1,title:'Ask.',text:'Start with a question.',kind:'ask'},
  {number:2,title:'Try.',text:'Take one small step.',kind:'try'},
  {number:3,title:'Share.',text:'Show someone how.',kind:'share'},
];
---
<div class="workshop-learning" id="features">
  <section class="learning-rhythm section-width" aria-labelledby="rhythm-title">
    <header class="section-heading"><h2 id="rhythm-title">Small steps. Together.</h2><p>Here’s the idea.</p></header>
    <ol class="rhythm-grid">{steps.map(step=><li><span class="step-number">{step.number}</span><div class={`step-picture ${step.kind}`} aria-hidden="true">{step.kind==='ask'?<svg viewBox="0 0 160 125"><path d="M22 18h116v77H72l-26 20V95H22Z" fill="#ffdf42" stroke="#873794" stroke-width="4" stroke-linejoin="round"/><text x="80" y="77" text-anchor="middle" font-size="62" font-weight="700" fill="#873794">?</text></svg>:step.kind==='try'?<svg viewBox="0 0 160 125"><path d="M15 105h40V77h40V48h45" fill="none" stroke="#b437ae" stroke-width="12" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><circle cx="37" cy="66" r="12" fill="#ea77c4"/><path d="m77 23 20-14 10 23" fill="none" stroke="#b437ae" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>:<svg viewBox="0 0 160 125"><circle cx="47" cy="33" r="18" fill="#ff7945"/><circle cx="114" cy="44" r="14" fill="#b437ae"/><path d="M17 103V87q0-28 30-28t30 28v16M88 103V88q0-23 26-23t26 23v15" fill="#ffb98b"/><path d="m56 87 24-8 25 8v24l-25-8-24 8Z" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#873794" stroke-width="3"/><path d="M80 79v24" stroke="#873794" stroke-width="3"/></svg>}</div><h3>{step.title}</h3><p>{step.text}</p></li>)}</ol>
    <p class="flow-note">Kids, teachers, and families can help each other.</p>
  </section>
  <section class="listening" aria-labelledby="listening-title"><div class="section-width">
    <header class="section-heading"><h2 id="listening-title">You told us.<br />We’re listening.</h2><p>Ideas from our workshop.</p></header>
    <div class="voice-grid">
      <article class="voice sage"><div class="voice-visual" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 220 120"><rect x="10" y="10" width="75" height="95" rx="8" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#b437ae" stroke-width="3"/><path d="M23 29h48M23 44h48M23 59h48M23 74h35M23 89h48" stroke="#e4b838" stroke-width="5"/><path d="M96 59h24m-8-8 9 8-9 8" stroke="#b437ae" fill="none" stroke-width="3"/><rect x="135" y="20" width="74" height="74" rx="8" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#b437ae" stroke-width="3"/><circle cx="189" cy="40" r="9" fill="#ff7945"/><path d="m143 79 19-24 17 15 13-13 10 22Z" fill="#e863b7"/></svg></div><h3>Show me.</h3><p>More pictures.<br />Fewer words.</p><span class="direction">An idea to work on</span></article>
      <article class="voice lavender"><div class="voice-visual" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 220 120"><path d="M20 16h150v65H83l-24 22V81H20Z" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#b437ae" stroke-width="3"/><circle cx="60" cy="48" r="7" fill="#ea77c4"/><circle cx="93" cy="48" r="7" fill="#ea77c4"/><circle cx="126" cy="48" r="7" fill="#ea77c4"/><path d="m172 60 27 26-14 3-3 15Z" fill="#b437ae" stroke="#ffffff" stroke-width="3"/></svg></div><h3>Help me ask.</h3><p>Tap a question.<br />Get started.</p><span class="direction">An idea to work on</span></article>
      <article class="voice peach"><div class="voice-visual languages" aria-hidden="true"><span>Hello!</span><span>¡Hola!</span></div><h3>Help us at home.</h3><p>English and Spanish.<br />Learn together.</p><span class="direction">An idea to work on</span></article>
    </div>
    <details class="source-details"><summary>About these ideas</summary><p>These short phrases sum up feedback from the October 6, 2026 Bonham workshop and its survey. They are not direct quotes. They describe ideas for future versions.</p></details>
  </div></section>
  <section class="next-iteration section-width" aria-labelledby="next-title"><header class="section-heading"><h2 id="next-title">What we want to make better.</h2></header><div class="priority-grid"><article><span class="priority-icon" aria-hidden="true">✓</span><h3>Get the math right.</h3><p>Check answers and pictures.</p></article><article><span class="priority-icon" aria-hidden="true">1 → 2</span><h3>Make it easier.</h3><p>One clear step at a time.</p></article><article><span class="priority-icon phone" aria-hidden="true"><span></span></span><h3>Fit your screen.</h3><p>Phone, tablet, or computer.</p></article></div><p class="plan-note">These are our suggested next steps.</p></section>
  <section class="foundation-goal section-width" id="learning-goal" aria-labelledby="foundation-title">
    <header class="section-heading"><span class="k12-label">Our goal: help kids across K–12</span><h2 id="foundation-title">Stuck on Grade 6 math?<br />Let’s see what needs practice.</h2><p>Your child may need help with something taught earlier.</p></header>
    <div class="foundation-map">
      <div class="path-heading"><span>1</span><h3>First, find where your child needs help.</h3></div>
      <ol class="grade-path back-path" aria-label="Example: check earlier math when needed">
        <li><span class="grade-name">Grade 6</span><strong>“I can’t do this yet.”</strong><p>Start with the question your child finds hard.</p></li>
        <li><span class="grade-name">Grade 5</span><strong>Can they do this part?</strong><p>Check the Grade 5 math needed for that question.</p></li>
        <li><span class="grade-name">Grade 4</span><strong>Still hard? Check here.</strong><p>Try the earlier Grade 4 math it builds on.</p></li>
      </ol>
      <div class="path-heading forward-heading"><span>2</span><h3>Then, teach each part until it makes sense.</h3></div>
      <ol class="grade-path forward-path" aria-label="Practice earlier math, then return to the hard question">
        <li><span class="grade-name">Grade 4</span><strong>Learn this part first.</strong><p>Practice it until your child can do it on their own.</p></li>
        <li><span class="grade-name">Grade 5</span><strong>Now learn the next part.</strong><p>Build on what they know. Practice again.</p></li>
        <li><span class="grade-name">Grade 6</span><strong>“Now I can do it!”</strong><p>Return to the first question and try it independently.</p></li>
      </ol>
    </div>
    <div class="goal-message"><span aria-hidden="true">✓</span><p><strong>Help your child understand—and do it on their own.</strong><br />Review just the parts they need, then return to today’s math.</p></div>
    <div class="goal-note"><p><strong>This is our plan for K–12.</strong> Today’s demo focuses on Grade 6.</p><p>This is one example. Each child starts where they need help.</p></div>
  </section>
  <section class="feedback-close section-width"><h2>Let’s learn together.</h2><a href="#demo">Try the example <span aria-hidden="true">↑</span></a></section>
</div>
<style>
.workshop-learning{font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:20px;line-height:1.5;color:#432647}.section-width{width:min(1120px,calc(100% - 64px));margin-inline:auto}.section-heading{text-align:center;margin:0 auto 38px}.section-heading h2,.feedback-close h2{font:700 clamp(32px,4vw,46px)/1.15 Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.025em}.section-heading>p{font-size:22px;margin-top:14px;color:#70526c}.learning-rhythm{padding:5px 0 65px}.rhythm-grid{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:48px}.rhythm-grid li{text-align:center;position:relative;background:#fff18a;border-radius:22px;padding:22px 20px 28px}.rhythm-grid li:nth-child(2){background:#ffd5ec}.rhythm-grid li:nth-child(3){background:#ead3ff}.rhythm-grid li+li:before{content:'→';position:absolute;left:-39px;top:42%;font-size:35px;color:#b437ae}.step-number{display:grid;place-items:center;width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:50%;background:white;font-weight:700;font-size:20px}.step-picture{width:150px;height:125px;margin:0 auto 10px}.step-picture svg{width:100%;height:100%}.rhythm-grid h3{font-size:36px;line-height:1.2;margin:0 0 12px;font-weight:700}.rhythm-grid p{font-size:20px}.flow-note{text-align:center;margin-top:25px;font-size:20px;color:#70526c}.listening{background:#fff9e8;padding:60px 0}.voice-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:22px}.voice{border-radius:22px;padding:25px 24px 22px;background:#fff18a}.voice.lavender{background:#ffd5ec}.voice.peach{background:#ffd4bd}.voice-visual{height:130px;margin:0 auto 22px;max-width:240px}.voice-visual svg{width:100%;height:100%}.voice h3{font-size:29px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.2;margin-bottom:18px;letter-spacing:-.02em}.voice>p{font-size:22px;line-height:1.6}.direction{display:block;border-top:1px solid #e6c549;padding-top:15px;margin-top:25px;font-size:16px;color:#745122}.lavender .direction{border-color:#e9a4cd;color:#833568}.peach .direction{border-color:#ef9877;color:#943c22}.languages{display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;gap:8px}.languages span{background:#ffffff;border:2px solid #e95638;border-radius:18px 18px 18px 3px;padding:7px 18px;font-size:25px;font-weight:700;align-self:flex-start}.languages span+span{align-self:flex-end;border-radius:18px 18px 3px 18px}.source-details{font-size:17px;line-height:1.7;margin-top:28px;color:#70526c}.source-details summary{cursor:pointer;font-weight:600;min-height:44px}.source-details p{max-width:830px;margin-top:12px}.next-iteration{padding:65px 0}.priority-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:32px;text-align:center}.priority-grid article{padding:10px 8px}.priority-icon{display:grid;place-items:center;min-width:80px;width:max-content;height:80px;margin:0 auto 22px;padding:0 10px;color:#b437ae;background:#ffe38a;border-radius:50%;font-size:40px;font-weight:700}.priority-grid article:nth-child(2) .priority-icon{font-size:26px}.priority-grid h3{font-size:25px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:12px}.priority-grid p{font-size:20px;color:#70526c}.phone>span{display:block;width:29px;height:45px;border:3px solid #b437ae;border-radius:6px;position:relative}.phone>span:after{content:'';position:absolute;width:9px;bottom:4px;left:7px;border-top:2px solid #b437ae}.plan-note{font-size:17px;color:#70526c;text-align:center;margin-top:35px}.feedback-close{border-radius:24px;background:#ffd5ec;padding:38px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:25px;margin-bottom:65px}.feedback-close h2{font-size:34px}.feedback-close a{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:20px;background:#b437ae;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 22px;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;font-size:20px;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap}a:focus-visible,summary:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #e95638;outline-offset:5px}
@media(max-width:750px){.section-width{width:calc(100% - 32px)}.rhythm-grid{gap:34px;grid-template-columns:1fr}.rhythm-grid li{display:grid;grid-template-columns:90px 1fr;gap:0 20px;text-align:left;padding:23px 20px}.step-number{position:absolute;left:12px;top:12px;font-size:16px;width:26px;height:26px}.step-picture{grid-row:span 2;width:90px;height:100px;margin:0}.rhythm-grid h3{align-self:end;font-size:32px;margin-bottom:7px}.rhythm-grid p{font-size:19px}.rhythm-grid li+li:before{content:'↓';left:calc(50% - 10px);top:-39px;font-size:30px}.flow-note{font-size:20px}.voice-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:18px}.voice{padding:25px}.voice-visual{height:110px;margin-left:0;margin-bottom:15px;max-width:180px}.voice h3{font-size:30px}.voice>p{font-size:22px}.direction{font-size:17px}.priority-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;text-align:left;gap:25px}.priority-grid article{display:grid;grid-template-columns:70px 1fr;gap:0 18px}.priority-icon{grid-row:span 2;width:65px;min-width:65px;height:65px;margin:0;font-size:35px}.priority-grid article:nth-child(2) .priority-icon{font-size:22px}.priority-grid h3{font-size:24px;margin-bottom:6px}.priority-grid p{font-size:19px}.feedback-close{display:block;padding:30px 24px}.feedback-close h2{font-size:31px}.feedback-close a{display:inline-flex;margin-top:24px;font-size:18px}.learning-rhythm{padding-bottom:45px}.listening{padding:45px 0}.next-iteration{padding:45px 0}.section-heading{margin-bottom:28px}}

.foundation-goal{padding:10px 0 60px}.foundation-goal .section-heading{max-width:850px}.k12-label{display:inline-block;background:#ffe86d;color:#873794;border-radius:24px;padding:9px 20px;font-size:20px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:22px}.foundation-map{background:#fffaf0;border:1px solid #f0d38d;border-radius:24px;padding:32px}.path-heading{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;margin-bottom:23px}.path-heading>span{display:grid;place-items:center;width:38px;height:38px;flex-shrink:0;background:#ffc3a4;border-radius:50%;font-size:20px;font-weight:700;color:#963c22}.path-heading h3{font-size:26px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:700}.grade-path{list-style:none;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:40px;margin:0;padding:0}.grade-path li{position:relative;background:#ffd4bd;padding:22px;border-radius:16px}.grade-path li+li:before{content:'→';position:absolute;left:-33px;top:43%;font-size:28px;color:#e95638}.grade-name{display:block;font-size:20px;color:#963c22;margin-bottom:14px}.grade-path strong{display:block;font-size:23px;line-height:1.3;margin-bottom:10px}.grade-path p{font-size:22px;line-height:1.5}.forward-heading{margin-top:32px}.forward-heading>span{background:#edb7ef;color:#873794}.forward-path li{background:#ead3ff}.forward-path .grade-name,.forward-path li+li:before{color:#873794}.forward-path li:last-child{background:#b437ae;color:#ffffff}.forward-path li:last-child .grade-name{color:#ffffff}.goal-message{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:20px;margin:26px auto 20px;max-width:920px}.goal-message>span{font-size:36px;color:#b437ae}.goal-message p{font-size:22px;line-height:1.6}.goal-note{font-size:22px;line-height:1.6;text-align:center;color:#432647;max-width:980px;margin:26px auto 0;background:#fff18a;border-radius:18px;padding:24px}.goal-note p+p{margin-top:10px}.goal-message strong{font-size:26px;line-height:1.4}
@media(max-width:750px){.foundation-goal{padding:0 0 45px}.k12-label{font-size:18px;padding:10px 14px}.foundation-map{padding:24px 18px}.path-heading h3{font-size:23px}.grade-path{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:30px}.grade-path li{padding:20px}.grade-path li+li:before{content:'↓';left:calc(50% - 10px);top:-34px;font-size:26px}.grade-path strong{font-size:23px}.grade-name{margin-bottom:8px;font-size:19px}.goal-message{align-items:flex-start;gap:12px}.goal-message p{font-size:20px}.goal-note{text-align:left;font-size:20px;padding:20px}.goal-message strong{font-size:24px}}
</style>
